{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-07_beg","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-07","title":"停滯","storyCode":"11-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e2d677c4517dc725ac5f6599626243cb1ecbd43bcb7e0574fe0b6c4b25c5f59c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"凱瑟琳給費斯特講述了工人們二十六年前的失敗抗爭。她將關於補給線的資訊留給了費斯特與博士。阿勒黛與推進之王在行動中遭到薩卡茲追捕。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"費斯特本以為自己又會挨一頓臭駡。\n他做好了準備，在心裡一遍遍打著腹稿，思索著什麼樣的說辭才能打動面前這位倔強的老工人。\n凱瑟琳見過的事情太多了，脾氣變得比廠裡的機器還硬。\n他的伶牙俐齒在凱瑟琳面前從來派不上用場。她嚴厲的目光又總像是能洞穿一切，以至於他引以為豪的頭腦也不自覺地成了一堆廢鐵。\n費斯特感到了熟悉的沮喪。\n在奶奶面前，他彷彿總會變回小孩子，舉止笨拙，情緒激烈，動不動說出一些令他自己後悔的話。他只能等著奶奶先開口。\n可凱瑟琳什麼都沒說。\n她領著費斯特走了很長一段路。在最終停下來的時候，費斯特偷偷瞥了眼奶奶的臉色。出乎意料的是，他沒有看到絲毫怒意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得這個工作室，你過去總是一個人來這裡。可為什麼流水線上是空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為這是什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老工人們都不肯說，但帕特跟戴打過賭，他猜這是你們......當年打造蒸汽甲胄的秘密工作室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴帕特，他贏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這真的是蒸汽甲胄......不，我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有幾回我偷偷跟著你走過這條路。那時候我明明聽見了......機器在轉，傳送帶也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有人打開電力開關，它們現在也能動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那為什麼停用這工作室？因為蒸汽騎士從維多利亞消失了嗎？不，就算沒有了訂單，這些機器也太寶貴了，沒有理由就此棄用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼停了......是啊，為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年長的工人拍了拍跟前的機器，就像對著那冷冰冰的金屬疙瘩發問一般。\n費斯特注意到，這裡所有的設備都一塵不染。時光彷彿在這秘密工作室裡停滯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道為什麼只有我一個人會到這裡來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡瑪，麥克，布蘭森......他們該站在那個位置。還有哈威，哈威負責盯著推進器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整條流水線動起來的時候......哈，我向你保證，你從來沒聽過更完美的節奏，什麼曲子都比不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈威......哈威不是爸爸的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸是整個廠裡最聰明的工人，腦子裡總會冒出許多稀奇古怪的主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在照片上見過他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該見見他的。你很像他......有時候我會覺得，太像了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈威他是蒸汽引擎的專家，他自己就像一台引擎。有時候帶著大家推進得太快，快得我都跟不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而我本該跟上他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸不是被捲入了一場街頭事故，然後失蹤了嗎？從小到大，我問的時候你都這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街頭事故......如果二十六年前的那場戰亂真的可以被稱作“事故”的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六年前？！陛下不就是在那時候被......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。一夜之間，倫蒂尼姆陷入了混亂。以大公爵為首，貴族們之間衝突不斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多工廠都受到了影響，尤其是我們這些生產蒸汽甲胄的軍工廠，全部被迫停工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈威他......那時候哈威還很年輕。對了，就和你如今的年紀差不多。他很愛這座工廠，也很愛這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天他和其他工人一起離開工廠，是想向貴族們發起抗議。他想讓公爵們聽一聽工人們的聲音，讓大家保住最基本的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......很天真對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍不住反反覆覆地想......十二月的倫蒂尼姆是不是很冷？他胸腔裡的鮮血流出來的時候，是不是還是熱的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸他......是為了理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為理想而犧牲是崇高的，你想說這個吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們自救軍的領導者們，那個“博士”......他們是不是都會在哀悼戰死的同伴時來回說著這幾句話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛維希婭指揮官會這樣說。博士......博士在這種時候比往常還要沉默。但他們都是真心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，死去的人並不能感覺到自己有多偉大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於活著的人......這些安慰的話就像煙，輕飄飄的。吸進肺裡的時候能舒坦些，等吐出來以後......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她真的吸了一口氣，頓了頓，緩緩吐到跟前。\n天不夠冷，空氣裡什麼都沒留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一件事是真的。二十六年前的那個晚上，四十一名工人走到了中央區的大街上，再也沒有回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，倫蒂尼姆還是什麼都沒變，那些貴族，有錢人，都想裝作什麼都沒有發生。這工作室卻再也沒能恢復原樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我老了，費斯特。我不可能再手把手教出一批這麼好的工人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來該輪到他們幹我幹的活。沒錯，哈威才該是教你所有事的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信不信由你，我從來沒有責怪過哈威。同樣，我也沒怪過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你必須想清楚，孩子。在你試圖帶著帕特他們暗中反抗的時候，你就該想清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一你活過了這場戰爭，其他人卻沒有回來，你想像我一樣，在無數個夜晚看著沒人用的機器，整個人都被遺憾和悔恨填滿嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，三年前，我不理解你做出的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，當我回想起那天，當我試圖去把自己放在你的位置上設身處地地去想的時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現，我連做那個決定恐怕都要猶豫很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，小聰明是騙不過死亡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，奶奶，我覺得妥協與順從同樣不能騙過它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱瑟琳深吸了一口煙，沒有反駁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，我不敢告訴你我想清楚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也無法拍著胸脯告訴你，我們一定能成功把這些薩卡茲趕出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，在羅德島告訴我們，我們的時間已經不多了之後，我更加感覺到，自己肩上的擔子有多重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很害怕我又會做蠢事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我不能因此而停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，我想，我一定沒有臉去面對老比爾、強尼、加比，還有那些在過去犧牲的自救軍成員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還太嫩了，臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫博士的傢伙，你看起來不像這小子，這麼大了還毛毛躁躁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你多多照顧他了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"放心。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我會盡力。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宿舍的書桌，左邊第三個抽屜裡面有一個暗格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲盯得很緊，這家工廠裡沒有你的位置，看完了就趕緊滾吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別給其他人添麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝，奶奶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在凱瑟琳與你擦肩而過時，你看到了她的表情。\n欣慰，悲傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，既然如此，我們快去奶奶說的地方看一看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走，奶奶的宿舍在這邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貨都到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀蒂先生最近怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說他病了。反正貨都給你們送來了，這趟交易算完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，請向他轉達我的感謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個又一個全副武裝的雇傭兵從倉庫深處走了出來。\n為首的那個來到自救軍面前，抬起沒有拿武器的那隻手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，新雇主。我是鉛踝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，鉛踝先生。這一路上辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，貨箱是有些悶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鉛踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來以後......好像也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，歡迎來到倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"八隊，帶這些新來的朋友去基地。注意避開附近的薩卡茲巡邏隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，指揮官。傭兵朋友們，跟我們來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......加上這最後一批武裝，我們又多了幾分力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛維希婭，我們的時間不多了，他們已經開始對貴族動手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經從公爵府撤出來了，轉移到了更加隱蔽的第二基地，現在還算比較安全，但不知道還能撐多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城內的薩卡茲數量還在增多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再過三天，薩卡茲的主力部隊就會回城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......食腐者之王。可怖骯髒的食屍鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭跟我說過一些他的能力。他以“吞食”戰爭為生。只要他站在戰場上......戰場就會變成他的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要以怎樣的代價，才能擊敗......戰場本身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵的艦隊若不能團結一心，就難有必勝的把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的戰士必須避開他，這就是我們必須在他回來之前行動的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就是活著的傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的王庭......如果他們真的準備越過萊托中校的城防軍，直接鎮壓整座城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克洛維希婭，你的數學很好。能不能告訴我，我們戰勝這群可怕傳說的機率有多大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，自救軍能走到今天，靠的也不是精確的計算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士們已經做到了最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論發生了什麼......起碼我們的心是齊的。是吧，阿勒黛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？嗯，當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿勒黛","speakerId":"avg_npc_397_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......希望明天的行動也能像這幾天一樣順利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們覺不覺得，最近的行動有點太順了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是好事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼好事會無緣無故地發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意維娜。走運一回就算了，哪可能回回走運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這個人是不是在附近轉了一陣子了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人站在路口，朝他們所在的方向瞥了一眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的目光並不能抵達巷子深處，理應什麼都看不見。可他像是受到了驚嚇似的收回了視線，匆匆低下了頭，飛快地走遠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......達格達！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻通知阿勒黛......通知全部自救軍，從倉庫區撤離！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是，推進之王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":true,"text":"他們問發生了什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人正盯著我們......不，來不及解釋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達，因陀羅，摩根，按計劃行動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人都撤走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先跑再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
